    "03 / Native layout and interaction",
    "393 × 852 source screen; safe areas 54 top / 34 bottom. Main content inset 21, discovery 16, entrance 24. Original map-first hierarchy; 116 × 150 restaurant preview, 13pt image/copy gap. Do not replace with a title and full-width action stack.",
    "45pt primary / 43pt minimum fields; 11pt primary / 9pt field / 10pt chip radii. Keep existing 35/38pt visual quick controls and extend hit areas to 44pt as needed. Retain the raised 53pt Create meal circle.",
    "Keyboard: original runtime owns focus, inset and dismissal; fields scroll into view. Back/cancel preserve confirmed data and discard only the relevant draft. Bottom sheets trap focus, dismiss by source rules and restore the trigger. Loading, disabled, retained-input error and unknown-result lookup remain distinct.",
    "04 / Accessibility and assets",
    "Do not rely on colour alone. Keep visible state labels, checked semantics, focus ring 2pt / offset 3pt, readable wrapping and explicit recovery. Respect reduced motion. Visual specimens do not certify VoiceOver or real-iOS conformance.",
    "Use the existing independent table illustration, restaurant, London map and fictional portraits. Maps/Places and real photos retain their attribution/licensing gates. UI screenshots are comparison evidence, never a flattened Figma interface."
